<title>UK: Sachsen Anhalt prices 1.0 bln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sachsen Anhalt prices 1.0 bln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earier by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Dresdner Bank, HSBC Trinkaus, Societe Generale and Westdeutsche Landesbank, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LAND SACHSEN ANHALT</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    09.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.466    PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.466    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT 2007 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	LANDESCHATZANWEISUNG AUSGABE 45</p>
<p>		THERE IS A REDENOMINATION INTO EUROS CLAUSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
